      "poi_id": "p81",
      "kind": "activity",
      "must_do_id": null,
      "note": "Coconut cream in a cup, cold enough to make your eyes go wide. Mr. Quân's little stall is a proper street-snack legend."
    },
    {
      "poi_id": "p4",
      "kind": "meal",
      "must_do_id": null,
      "note": "Crackly rice paper, soft noodles, a good whack of fish sauce. Smash it, dip it, repeat until the plate looks lonely."
    },
    {
      "poi_id": "p31",
      "kind": "activity",
      "must_do_id": null,
      "note": "Sand between your toes and the sea doing its slow night breathing. A beach club with the volume turned to island time."
    }
  ]
}
